      "mergedPostDetails": "She is Touching my hands in her view.\n\nIt seems like her avatar is on remote view \"lifted\". At the end you can see where she lays down that her Nametag is not above her head. Her nametag ist attached to her hip. The Avatar seem to be offset on remote or so?\n\nShe is on live. I'm on open beta. It's limited to this Avatar (avtr_da48291d-0c64-4af6-9d13-1709a9b396bd) so far.\n\nI doesn't happen while we are both on live.\n\nWe haven't tested it while we are both using open beta.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/FiNfcRXwIgY\n\nHer eyehight is set to 0.96m. She is 0.96m when I copy her eye hight while unsing live. She is 1.35m when I copy her eye hight while using open beta.",
