      "value": "I found that this issue infects live client versions if it is a beta user that experiences the issue. What I mean is when the beta user's avatar is failing to register the scale properly, the live client users will see them bugged out and not the correct scale.\n\nFriend on the live release saw my avatar was partially in the ground or even standing at avatar default height instead of the size i set it to.",
